<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16243" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ēscensĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		escendo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an ascension</i>, <i>a mounting</i>,
				<i>climbing</i>, <i>going up</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adversus regem escensionem a Paesto facientem
					pugnare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					8, 17, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in agrum Uticensem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					27, 5, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad urbem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					27, 29, 7</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">28, 8, 8</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">37, 17,
				3</span></i>.—<i>Plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in agros,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					29, 28, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Esp., <i>a disembarkation</i>, <i>landing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ab navibus in terram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					22, 20, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">classis escensionem ad populandum fecit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					44, 10, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
